  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Session contract",
      "items": [
        "每条顶层输入冻结一次 W；最新 checkpoint 加 W 之后的 durable tail 构成 Snapshot。",
        "SessionCheckpoint 只恢复已提交认知；旧 Job、旧 approval 与旧 action eligibility 不会复活。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Job contract",
      "items": [
        "JobCheckpoint 只压已读、冻结的 Record 前缀；JobSpec、constraints、raw tail 与未读 cursor 不能静默丢失。",
        "Worker 不拥有 Session history；只有 Coordinator 显式投递必要的 grounded context。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Provider contract",
      "items": [
        "Adapter 在最终 wire render 后做 token seal，不在此层删内容或总结。",
        "一次精确重规划仍超限时返回 ContextCapacity，禁止无限 compaction loop。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Crash contract",
      "items": [
        "active Job → Interrupted；in-flight model → Abandoned；write effect → Unknown → reconcile。",
        "Runtime 仅在 quiescent barrier 轮换：没有 active Job、running tool 或 unresolved write effect。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
